      "unordered": [
        {
          "text": "**Role:** Assign the LLM a persona. \"Act as an academic researcher specializing in cognitive science.\" This focuses the model's vast knowledge, guiding its tone, vocabulary, and analytical lens.16",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 63,
          "source": "prompt-report-the-prompt-engineer's-codex-a-masterclass-in-dialogue-with-ai-20251120082834.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Task:** State the primary action clearly and unambiguously. \"Summarize the key findings of the following research paper.\"",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 65,
          "source": "prompt-report-the-prompt-engineer's-codex-a-masterclass-in-dialogue-with-ai-20251120082834.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Context:** Provide the necessary background information. \"...the paper explores the effects of sleep deprivation on memory consolidation.\"",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 66,
          "source": "prompt-report-the-prompt-engineer's-codex-a-masterclass-in-dialogue-with-ai-20251120082834.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Format & Constraints:** Define the structure and limits of the output. \"Present the summary as a series of five bullet points, with a total word count under 300 words.\"",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 67,
          "source": "prompt-report-the-prompt-engineer's-codex-a-masterclass-in-dialogue-with-ai-20251120082834.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Thought:** The model reasons about what it needs to do next to solve the problem. (\"I need to find the latest research on CRISPR gene editing.\")",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 158,
          "source": "prompt-report-the-prompt-engineer's-codex-a-masterclass-in-dialogue-with-ai-20251120082834.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Action:** The model executes an action by calling an external tool. (e.g., `SearchAPI`)",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 162,
          "source": "prompt-report-the-prompt-engineer's-codex-a-masterclass-in-dialogue-with-ai-20251120082834.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Observation:** The result from the tool is fed back into the model's context. (\"The search returned three papers from 2024...\")",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 162,
          "source": "prompt-report-the-prompt-engineer's-codex-a-masterclass-in-dialogue-with-ai-20251120082834.md"
        }
      ]
